{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of comparable elements in ascending order using the Comb Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    # Create a shallow copy of the list to preserve immutability of the original.\n    data = arr.copy()\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        if gap > 1:\n            gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n            if gap < 1:  # Ensure gap doesn't become 0, minimum gap is 1\n                gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if data[i] > data[i + gap]:\n                data[i], data[i + gap] = data[i + gap], data[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return data"}
